## LeadFormsApi

### Get lead form by id
## Get lead form by id
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/lead_forms/{{lead_form_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Create lead form test data
## Create lead form test data
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/lead_forms/{{lead_form_id}}/test
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "answers": "<string>"
}


### Create lead forms
## Create lead forms
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/lead_forms
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### List lead forms
## List lead forms
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/lead_forms?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}
Accept: application/json

### Update lead forms
## Update lead forms
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/lead_forms
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}

